              >
                <line
                  x1="18"
                  x2="6"
                  y1="6"
                  y2="18"
                />
                <line
                  x1="6"
                  x2="18"
                  y1="6"
                  y2="18"
                />
              </svg>
               Close
            </span>
          </span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div
        style="flex: 1 1 0%; min-height: 0;"
      >
        <div
          class="relative h-full"
        >
          <div
            class="relative flex h-full flex-col"
            style="background-color: rgb(11, 18, 32);"
          >
            <div
              class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 px-4 py-2.5"
              style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);"
            >
              <div
                data-testid="session-picker"
                style="position: relative; min-width: 0;"
              >
                <button
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-label="Choose chat session"
                  class="pa-btn"
                  style="--pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-fg-hover: #00D5FF; --pa-btn-bg-hover: transparent; --pa-btn-pad: 0; --pa-btn-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 4px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;"
                  type="button"
                >
                  <span
                    style="overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; min-width: 0;"
                  >
                    Agent
                  </span>
                  <svg
                    fill="none"
                    height="10"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    style="flex-shrink: 0;"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    width="10"
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                  >
                    <polyline
                      points="6 9 12 15 18 9"
                    />
                  </svg>
                </button>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div
                  class="relative"
                  data-testid="provider-model-picker"
                >
                  <button
                    aria-expanded="false"
                    aria-haspopup="dialog"
                    aria-label="Choose chat provider and model"
                    class="pa-btn w-full"
                    style="--pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-pad: 0 10px; --pa-btn-radius: 8px; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; height: 26px; min-height: 0;"
                    type="button"
                  >
                    <span
                      class="truncate text-left flex items-baseline gap-2 min-w-0"
                    >
                      <span
                        class="truncate"
                        style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 400; font-family: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;"
                      >
                        Change model
                      </span>
                    </span>
                    <svg
                      fill="none"
                      height="13"
                      stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                      stroke-width="2"
                      style="color: rgb(90, 100, 120); transition: transform 160ms;"
                      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                      width="13"
                      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    >
                      <polyline
                        points="6 9 12 15 18 9"
                      />
                    </svg>
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="flex min-h-0 flex-1 items-center justify-center overflow-y-auto p-4"
            >
              <section
                aria-label="Chat model setup"
                data-state="needs-model"
                data-testid="chat-setup-card"
                style="width: 100%; max-width: 420px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07); border-radius: 12px; background: rgb(30, 36, 51); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04); font-family: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;"
              >
                <p
                  style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(138, 148, 166); font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em;"
                >
                  CHAT SETUP
                </p>
                <h2
                  style="margin: 8px 0px 6px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: "Manrope", "Satoshi", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.25;"
                >
                  Choose a model for Chat
                </h2>
                <p
                  style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(138, 148, 166); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55;"
                >
                  Chat needs a selected model before it can reply. Choose a hosted provider and model, or set up a model on this Mac.
                </p>
                <div
                  class="flex flex-wrap items-center"
                  style="gap: 6px; margin-top: 16px;"
                >
                  <button
                    class="pa-btn pa-btn--primary"
                    style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: #00D5FF; --pa-btn-fg: #04141B; --pa-btn-border: transparent; --pa-btn-bg-hover: #00D5FF; --pa-btn-border-hover: transparent; --pa-btn-bg-active: #00D5FF; --pa-btn-pad: 7px 12px; --pa-btn-weight: 600;"
                    type="button"
                  >
                    <span
                      class="pa-btn__label"
                    >
                      Open model setup
                    </span>
                  </button>
                </div>
                <p
                  style="margin: 10px 0px 0px; color: rgb(138, 148, 166); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5;"
                >
                  Settings → Models includes local models and a route to provider API keys. Opening setup does not send a message.
                </p>
              </section>
            </div>
            <div
              id="meeting-dock-slot"
              style="flex-shrink: 0; max-height: 45%; overflow-y: auto;"
            />
            <div
              class="p-3"
              style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07); background-color: rgb(30, 36, 51);"
            >
              <div
                class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-2"
